WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:16.593
Tom was playing with his sisters.

2
00:00:16.594 --> 00:00:21.898
The three kittens played in the yard.

3
00:00:21.899 --> 00:00:28.436
They chased butterflies.

4
00:00:28.437 --> 00:00:37.419
They played tag.

5
00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:45.726
But soon Tom got bored.

6
00:00:45.727 --> 00:00:50.863
Tom looked toward the gate.

7
00:00:50.864 --> 00:01:03.162
"Hmm," he thought. "What's that?"

8
00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:07.398
Tom crawled under the gate.

9
00:01:07.399 --> 00:01:11.026
"Where are you going, Tom?" Moppet asked.

10
00:01:11.027 --> 00:01:15.025
Tom did not answer.

11
00:01:15.026 --> 00:01:20.942
So Moppet crawled under the gate too.

12
00:01:20.943 --> 00:01:23.906
Mittens frowned at Tom and Moppet.

13
00:01:23.907 --> 00:01:29.218
"Don't go near the road!" she said.

14
00:01:29.219 --> 00:01:36.259
Tom and Moppet ran toward the road.

15
00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:45.776
"Mittens!" Tom said. "Look what we found!"

16
00:01:45.777 --> 00:01:48.998
Mittens crawled under the gate.

17
00:01:48.999 --> 00:01:52.614
She ran to her brother and sister.

18
00:01:52.615 --> 00:01:56.810
"We found a box!" Moppet said.

19
00:01:56.811 --> 00:02:00.109
The kittens jumped into the wooden box.

20
00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:04.015
It was full of wool.

21
00:02:04.016 --> 00:02:08.817
"It's cozy in here," Moppet said.

22
00:02:08.824 --> 00:02:17.482
"It's a secret hiding place!" said Tom.

23
00:02:17.483 --> 00:02:22.701
Mittens looked worried.

24
00:02:22.702 --> 00:02:26.589
"We have to go home soon," she said.

25
00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:30.128
Suddenly Tom heard a man's voice.

26
00:02:30.129 --> 00:02:34.889
It was the farmer.

27
00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.287
Then the box went up.

28
00:02:37.288 --> 00:02:42.645
"Uh-oh," Tom thought.
